      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After discussing with Merlin, it is suggested that the compilers should be handling setting of the old value at the end of the change callback. This means that this canny is more a bug for the UdonGraph compiler and not the runtime handling of when the change callback is called from SetHeapVariable.\nFrom my point of view, it is still unclear on vrchat's intentions if runtime should handle this or the compiler. It would be nice if there was better documentation on handling these events for compiler writers. Since writing this canny I have updated CyanTriggers to set the value at the end of the change callback.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
